{#- An author's note (play controls V): a standing instruction inserted into
    the conversation history as its own system message, at a chosen depth.
    Rendered once per note that applies to this turn -- campaign, then scene,
    then the character note, which only that character's own call receives.
    Vars: level ("campaign" | "scene" | "character"), name (the character's
    name for a character note, "" otherwise), text. -#}
{%- if level == "character" -%}
[Author's note for {{ name }}: {{ text }}]
{%- else -%}
[Author's note: {{ text }}]
{%- endif -%}
